record.description_evidence:
Panda AI is an AI Assistant, you could ask whatever questions of whatever fields. You can create any bot account with special prompts or just import from Discover Center. There are 2 plans. 1. Free Plan: You can fill it with your own API key, then chat totally free; 2. Pro plan: Nothing else to do and use it freely, both one-time fee and monthly subscriptions supported.
Features:
1. Add Different Bot Roles such as Doctor/Translator/wiki;
2. Add useful replies to Favorites;
3. Custom host to your own Server;
4. Dark mode;
5. Chat Prompt Center;

